  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KAZOZA | Rice Hulling &amp; Production Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2500 beneficiaries, 1100 women beneficiaries. ASSOPRO Ninga aims to increase its sales revenue and production of rice by building a drying yard, procuring moto-tricycles, and purchasing seed inputs to increase their output of rice and meet local wholesalers&apos; demands.</narrative>
  </description>
